    "id": "e68f22baa08d4638af76ef26b17ff821",
    "title": "A vertical mobile portrait (9:16 aspect ratio) version of this serene architectural sanctuary at golden hour sunset based on the reference image. The composition features smooth curved plaster architectural walls, an elegant arched doorway looking out onto a tranquil lake and layered mountain landscape bathed in warm golden sunset light. On the polished warm concrete/stone floor, there is a smooth marble or limestone sphere sculpture resting beside a soft curved organic architectural bench or step. Natural warm sunlight cascades across the plaster wall and floor with soft angled shadows. Maintain the exact same serene, quiet, meditative aesthetic, warm oat and espresso color tones, tactile minimalism, and golden hour lighting adapted seamlessly for a 9:16 mobile wallpaper or background.",
    "deviceType": null,
